# GS23: Roman and sound content (2026-10-23). Metadata scouted live: every
# page was opened and every file's md5 is of the bytes that URL served on
# 2026-10-23. Rows are licence-checked: CC0, or CC-BY 3.0 with the required
# attribution text at the end of the row (the tool refuses a CC-BY row that
# has none, and writes the text into the license sidecar). No NC, no ND.
#
# Format: <source> <id> <url> [md5] [license] [author] [attribution text]
# (tools/fetch-content.mjs).
#
# --- 4 Roman props, glb (Poly Pizza, CC-BY 3.0) ---
