#   Roman Arch      poly.pizza/m/agiRDMN0VR  Icawfype        5,198 tris
#     (the page's Tris field reads 0; the glb holds one mesh, 5,198 tris,
#     5,198 x 3 indices, one material, no images - checked in the bytes.)
# CC-BY 3.0 needs credit: the attribution text is part of the row.
